ない場面ってありますか？\nもしなければ通常の文法からquoteを外しちゃえば静的にわかる部分が増えそうですね","ts":"1625564424.064800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NqZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a069b0c-8d02-4a07-9dbd-05e9537d2715","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"確かにそもそもquoteを使わずにlistを表現すれば良さそうですね","ts":"1625564330.062500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oE/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"859ff38c-1c90-4964-b396-b56ea2276e48","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"elsa見てみます！","ts":"1625564288.061700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0h7e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dd7eacb-9c92-41e9-807e-45cc92c6f6cf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"`(car (list 1 2 3))` をvalidにして `(car (print 10))` を型エラーにしたいという話であれば、Elsaのように型注釈をコメントで書けばできそう。\nlistとprintは明らかに返り値の型が違うので。","ts":"1625564119.061100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cwn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0e23044-cf40-4651-b5a0-4d79bac170c6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; 例えばlistを引数にとる iterate 関数を`(iterate '(1 2 3))` はvalidだけど (iterate '(print 10)) はinvalidにしたいです\nElispにはiterateはないのでcarを例にしますが、(この関数はListを与えないとエラーになる)\n`(car '(1 2 3))` も `(car '(print 10))` も両方validです。結果は次のとおりです。\n```(car '(1 2 3))\n;;=\u0026gt; 1\n\n(car '(print 10))\n;;=\u0026gt; print```","ts":"1625564004.060700","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625564024.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S8n4j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd7c4d2c-c844-491b-b113-38c1c9ee156e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01BDNKLAV9/p1625562726045200\u003e\nこれは無理そう。","ts":"1625563918.060400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 6th, 2021 2:12 AM] dev428: 例えばlistを引数にとる `iterat