ab7b-806c2d2b75b9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"例えばRustのマクロはSchemeっぽさありますし","ts":"1625563196.052600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uv5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43a4d690-42da-4150-ad07-a94ce4ae73f2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Schemeにあるパターンマッチマクロなら静的解析は比較的容易そう","ts":"1625563182.052000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i2mJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fc10c94-5f07-4d91-aec3-1c6518d756ce","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"シンボルが何を表しているかに関しても型の情報が付けられるようにしようと思っています","ts":"1625563171.051500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YS0H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bef63853-77d3-458b-b41c-6684fbb755c2","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"マクロの便利さを殺したくないからコードをデータとして扱える余地は残したいけど、できるだけたくさんのことを静的に解析できるようにしたいから自由すぎるのも困るというので延々悩んでいます","ts":"1625563127.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jswd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a61d731-5253-4a62-b48e-dd4584799abd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"シンボルが数値を指してるか、リストを指してるかは評価するまで分からないので\n```;;;(setq a 1)\n(setq a (quote (1 2 3))\n(print (eval '(+ 1 a)))```\nなにかアノテーション的なのを使わないと難しいんじゃないですかね。(僕は Lisp 詳しくない)","ts":"1625562971.049100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oP8Ta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc8756c6-24c2-4804-8217-9e8288ed1069","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"そもそもLispでそこを縛るのが正しいのかはわかりませんが","ts":"1625562830.046600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"klzW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec2ed80a-958e-4242-a725-a1b3a78c1134","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"それをコンパイルエラーとして扱いたかったらリスト用のシンタックスを用意しないといけないんですね","ts":"1625562810.046200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VuU3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da7773d6-98ae-4076-8ada-c8c81c4ce97d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ランタイムエラーになるんじゃないですかね。","ts":"1625562742.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H=zXv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1a2ce4f-ef4d-450c-bbd3-f7946d198d2f","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"例えばlistを引数にとる `iterate` 関数を`(iterate '(1 2 3))` はvalidだけど `(iterate '(print 10))` はinvalidにしたいです","ts":"1625562726.045200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RMuq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94fd0dd6-e4a8-4ca9-bd6b-b287213dab9b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"停止性問題か \u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C\u003e","ts":"1625562624.043400","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 停止性問題","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"停止性問題","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C","text":"計算可能性理論において停止性問題（ていしせいもんだい、英: halting problem）または停止問題は、「どんなチューリングマシン、あるいは同様な計算機構についても、それが有限時間で停止するかを判定できるアルゴリズム」は可能か、という問題。\nアラン・チューリングは1936年、停止性問題を解くアルゴリズムは存在しないことをある種の対角線論法のようにして証明した。\nすなわち、そのようなアルゴリズムを実行できるチューリングマシンの存在を仮定すると「自身が停止するならば無限ループに陥って停止せず、停止しないならば停止する」ような別の構成が可能ということになり、矛盾となる。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%80%A7%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V9tT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32046da9-6f19-4d58-9adf-5e3b8e40517a","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"他の型付の言語のように引数の型を指定しようとするなら、クオートを使ったリストの表現だと難しいのでしょうか","ts":"1625562608.042800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j=LHs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e027ea86-c4fe-4444-a881-21a5bbb2218a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プログラムがちゃんと動くかって実行せずに解けない問題ですね確か","ts":"1625562556.041800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"erA2t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b47db42d-c5ef-4801-91a8-eeb18910af8b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```(setq a 1)\n(print (eval '(+ 1 a)))```\nこれは valid のはずですしね。","ts":"1625562380.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TNz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"196f2f49-ffc4-4e47-bc24-056effaf216e","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625562149.040200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CHE7q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd27b610-e419-4869-9ea9-dc121bbb9f0a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ちなみに cisp は lisp-2","ts":"1625562148.040100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CyVzG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b31b61a9-c045-4867-83b8-4efbc77451f4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そのはずです。","ts":"1625562126.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nc1Bz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9adac0c2-acf7-421f-b743-48ba10044325","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"lisp1を作りたいなと思っています","ts":"1625562125.039600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c618ac4a-3ce3-40b1-9184-18584e7621cc","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"例えば `quote` されたものが `eval` できるかはやってみないとわからないということでしょうか？","ts":"1625562112.039100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hs9yj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c86f378f-5709-4124-96da-a868b974f94f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"common lisp は lisp-2","ts":"1625562112.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jGe/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"549e69fa-0bc6-4fb4-b0eb-127484ae7622","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"めんどくさいのが、lisp-1 と lisp-2 では評価の順が違うんですよね。","ts":"1625562099.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YJwq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e42aa051-1f1a-4127-9717-60b8a3696a64","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"評価しないまま入れる感じで。","ts":"1625561889.037100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d85c071-d138-4df1-962b-3193c32cdc77","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"quote って AST レベルで car に入れるだけだと思ってますが違うのかな。","ts":"1625561761.036700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8q9S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1be4e139-1f26-4047-9d4e-2a24ec1b46d3","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"自分の中でもまだイメージが固まっているわけではないのですが型付のLispにしたいなと思っていて、\n`'(1 2 3 4)` がリストなのか関数が適用される前の式なのかをどうにか見分けられないかなと考えていました","ts":"1625561506.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kji"}]},{"client_msg_id":"730fb62a-6b2a-4c4a-8299-7e9d17012ebc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```'(+ 1 2 3)\n;;=\u0026gt; (+ 1 2 3)\n\n(quote (+ 1 2 3))\n;;=\u0026gt; (+ 1 2 3)\n\n(+ 1 2 3)\n;;=\u0026gt; 6\n\n;;;;;\n\n'a\n;;=\u0026gt; a\n\n(quote a)\n;;=\u0026gt; a\n\na\n;;=\u0026gt; Debugger entered--Lisp error: (void-variable a)\n;;     (progn a)\n;;     eval((progn a) t)\n;;     elisp--eval-last-sexp(t)\n;;     eval-last-sexp(t)\n;;     eval-print-last-sexp(nil)\n;;     funcall-interactively(eval-print-last-sexp nil)\n;;     call-interactively(eval-print-last-sexp nil nil)\n;;     command-execute(eval-print-last-sexp)```","ts":"1625561304.034200","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625561322.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cafc1c95-ab92-4742-8973-81c4a6f695bb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"パーサを書いたことがないので詳しくないですが。。\nとりあえず、なぜリストなのか関数の呼び出しなのかを区別する必要があるのか分からないです。\n'を見つけたらreadしてその対象をquoteで括るだけに思えます(Elispのユーザーとしては)","ts":"1625561140.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SyRc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"486472f8-69ab-47ba-8a0b-d2e8dbab7d17","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"もし詳しい方がいたら教えていただきたいです","ts":"1625560808.033600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MV1P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b03cd19-1d89-4ec8-af79-7efa44d16afd","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"そもそもクオートされているものがリストなのか関数の呼び出しなのかが、パーサーの時点で確定させられないような気がしていて、どういう実装にするか悩んでいます。","ts":"1625560792.033200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PXOrX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f9a4b04-3730-4be6-92c5-318cf014e017","type":"message","user":"U01HWNHS5NF","text":"自作Lisp言語を作っていて、パーサーにおける `quote` の扱いに困っているんですが、lispだと任意の式をクオートできるので、思いついたままに実装するとパーサーが吐くastでクオートしたものの内容を詳細に表現できなくて","ts":"1625560730.032100","edited":{"user":"U01HWNHS5NF","ts":"1625560824.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CD8N3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4dd5c38-a6d0-4e08-8573-9bdcd86c067b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/cisp/search?l=newlisp\u003e\nNewLisp...?","ts":"1625559338.029800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZG2K5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d171c4e-34c3-4ee8-9dc5-f380006edec4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Elispのマクロがなぜ便利かってやはりその場で展開結果が分かるからだと思うんですよね。\n\u003chttp://emacs.rubikitch.com/macrostep/\u003e\n別言語でマクロっぽいものを作ってもデバック困難になるだけかな。。と思って自作Lisp作る手を自分で止めてしまいました。。\nかといってCLは配布目的だと (チームのスキルセット的にも) あまりマッチしないな。とも思ってしまい。","ts":"1625558925.029500","attachments":[{"fallback":"るびきち「新生日刊Emacs」: macrostep.el : 【コードリーディング支援】elispのマクロ展開をその場で順番に眺める","id":1,"title":"macrostep.el : 【コードリーディング支援】elispのマクロ展開をその場で順番に眺める","title_link":"http://emacs.rubikitch.com/macrostep/","text":"概要 Lispのマクロはとても強力で、制御構造すら隠蔽できてしまいます。 もちろんelispだって例外ではありません。 マクロは何度も「展開」され、 最終的にはスペシャルフォームと関数のみになります。 マクロは便利さの反・・・","thumb_url":"http://emacs.rubikitch.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/emacs.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1430542260,"service_name":"るびきち「新生日刊Emacs」","service_icon":"http://emacs.rubikitch.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/cropped-emacs-180x180.jpg","thumb_width":512,"thumb_height":512,"from_url":"http://emacs.rubikitch.com/macrostep/","original_url":"http://emacs.rubikitch.com/macrostep/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ddl5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42e1be91-8bcc-41cd-883d-b369f3e1c957","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"基本的なのは動くんだけど。 \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/cisp/tree/master/t\u003e","ts":"1625558707.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4nK6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef554e39-d924-4ec3-9b90-eff0a8d5770a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"自作 Lisp でマクロがちゃんと実装できてないままだなぁ。いつか実装したい。","ts":"1625558666.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Dqp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9033c64-1c36-4790-a08d-8359c